  "description": "Experience unforgettable trail adventures! With its 160 mm of travel and its agile geometry, the Root Miller 1 offers you everything you need for endless kilometres of fun on the trails. The robust Sunringle Düroc 37 Comp aluminium wheelset is equipped with Continental’s ultimate gravity tyre Kryptotal Trail Endurance at the front and the rear wheel – this combination of aggressive treads and lightweight 29\" wheels is perfect for trail use and offers you massive grip on almost any ground. The travel of the E13 Vario Infinite seat post can be shortened by a total of 30 mm in just a few steps and thus perfectly adapts to your individual needs. * approx. 16.2 kg, may vary by up to +/- 5 % due to manufacturing tolerances, weight for matt lava orange frame, size L, without pedals.",
